  m_Text: "Greetings\nI need a gift for a birthday.\nIf it isn't too much to ask,
    I would need an aftertaste of Freshness but also an aftertaste of Relaxation.
    Could you also put something scarcely sweet ? \nI want something simple.\nI will
    need it at most in six days.\nThank you in advance."
