    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "I want some tea.\nIf it isn't too much to ask, I would need a hint of
    Freshness but also a little bit of Relaxation. I also really need a small amount
    of Sweetness. \nI need a lot of tea.\nCan you deliver it at most within five
    days ?"
