  m_Text: "I want to gift tea to a friend for a birthday.\nIf it isn't too much to
    ask, I would need a small amount of Warmth and a small amount of Relaxation.
    I also want to have something not too sweet. \n\nCan you deliver it at most before
    next week ?"
