  m_Text: "Dear Sir or Madam,\nI am running out of tea{long(. I need some)}.\nIf
    it isn't too much to ask, I would need a hint of Freshness and a small amount
    of Relaxation. Could you also put something tangy ? \nI want something simple.\nI
    would need it {day}.in four days\nThank you in advance."
