    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Dear Sir or Madam,\nI would love to test some new tea. I need it in six
    days.\nI want to have something a little warm and also not too relaxing. Could
    you also put something scarcely tangy ? \nI need a lot of tea.\nThank you."
