  m_Text: "Hello !\nI want to gift tea to a friend for a birthday. We will do it
    in two days.\nIf it isn't too much to ask, I would need a small amount of Freshness
    and a little bit of Relaxation. I also really need an aftertaste of Sweetness.
    \n\nThank you"
