  m_Text: "Dear Sir or Madam,\nI am having friends over.\nCould you put something
    not too fresh + not too relaxing ? I also really need an aftertaste of Tanginess.
    \nBut I don't want something complex.\nI will need it at most in six days.\nThank
    you"
