  m_Text: "Dear Sir or Madam,\nI will get going.\nI really need a little bit of Warmth
    and a small amount of Energy. Could you also put something a little sweet ? \nI
    need a lot of tea.\nCan you deliver it at most for the day after tomorrow ?\nLooking
    forward to recieving the tea."
