  m_Text: "Greetings\nI want to gift tea to a friend for a birthday{long(. We will
    do it)} in five days.\nI really need Freshness + a hint of Energy. Could you
    also put something tangy ? \nI need a lot of tea.\nLooking forward to recieving
    the tea."
