  m_Text: 'Hi,



    I need to crunch some numbers and meet a deadline in about
    3 days, you got anything that''d give me enough energy to keep me awake through
    an all-nighter ? Make it tangy while you''re at it, that''d be nice.



    Thanks
    in advance.'
